      <div class="meta">Updated July 2026 · Ranked 5 platforms · Website Builder Pillar</div>

      <p>The right website builder turns your design into a fast, maintainable, SEO-friendly site without writing code from scratch. The wrong builder produces slow pages, rigid templates, and a rewrite 18 months later. We ranked Webflow, Framer, WordPress, Squarespace, and Wix on design flexibility, learning curve, CMS capability, SEO, page performance, pricing, and developer handoff quality. Also explore the <a href="/reviews/website-builder/">Website Builder Pillar</a> for head-to-head comparisons.</p>

